Torque is the tendency of a force to rotate an object about an axis. AddTorque
adds a torque force to a Rigidbody. As a result the rigidbody will start spinning
around the torque axis.
public void AddTorque(Vector3 torque, ForceMode mode = ForceMode.Force);
public void AddTorque(float x, float y, float z, ForceMode mode = ForceMode.Force);
The force is applied following
the left hand screw rule:
